# QA M3, Stage 4 checkpoint respawn in the shaft (game-design.md "New
# mechanics": die in the shaft after the checkpoint -> respawn at 114 as
# Normal, level reset, M-box fresh), and time-up while climbing. The
# solver route past the checkpoint (730) to the path below the M-box
# (col 117); Resi bumps it, follows the Mozartkugel into the shaft
# (Zuckerschock at 909), jumps onto the row-23 plank and waits there. The
# shaft has no enemy that could kill her (see the QA report), so the
# timer does: time-up at 14430 on the plank (death as Zuckerschock).
# Respawn at the checkpoint (1826, feet framed at screen y 148, timer
# 240) as Normal; the M-box is fresh: she bumps it again and grows again
# (second PowerUp at 14807), so the end state is Zuckerschock.
# If the solver route changes, re-copy the prefix and re-check the frames.
level  = falkenstein
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = dies_at frames=14430..14430 deaths=1 lives=2 event=Respawned event=CheckpointReached power=big player_x>=1880 state=playing
---
